#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:102
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is smart.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王真聪明。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:109
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_TedIntro"
msgid "Which switch closes which hole?$"
msgstr "哪个开关能堵上哪个洞呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:112
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_TedDefeat"
msgid ""
"After that battle, I'm even more\n"
"confused!$"
msgstr "打完这场对战，我更糊涂了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_TedPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Can I get you to push all the buttons\n"
"for me?$"
msgstr "能请你帮我把所有的按钮都按一遍吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_PaulIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh! You're on your second TRICK HOUSE\n"
"challenge!$"
msgstr "哦！你在进行第二次机关屋挑战啊！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:124
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_PaulDefeat"
msgid "You're good at battling too?$"
msgstr "你连对战也很厉害吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:127
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_PaulPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The TRICK MASTER rigged all the tricks\n"
"in this house all by himself.$"
msgstr ""
"这间房子里所有的机关，\n"
"都是机关大王一个人设计的。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:131
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_GeorgiaIntro"
msgid ""
"I want to make my own GYM one day.\n"
"So, I'm studying how to set traps.$"
msgstr ""
"我想有一天开一座自己的道馆。\n"
"所以我正在研究怎么设置陷阱。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:135
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_GeorgiaDefeat"
msgid "I didn't study battling enough!$"
msgstr "我对战研究得还不够！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2/scripts.inc:138
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_GeorgiaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're strong, aren't you?\n"
"Maybe even enough to be a GYM LEADER!$"
msgstr "你很强嘛？说不定都能当道馆馆主了！$"
